### Cadastro
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/cadastro
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Usuario Teste",
    "email": "teste@example.com",
    "senha": "SenhaTeste123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "teste@example.com",
    "senha": "SenhaTeste123"
}

